      "volume_candidate": 3,
      "volume_part": "",
      "volume_verified": false,
      "structural_volume_verified": true,
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "夏四月甲申，遷元梁王把匝剌瓦兒密及威順王子伯伯等家屬於耽羅。丙戌，詔天下通祀孔子。壬辰，免畿內、浙江、江西、河南、山東稅糧。",
      "boundary_basis": "epub_source_paragraph",
      "review_status": "pending",
      "flags": [],
      "locator": {
